<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>위탁계약서 자동 생성 시스템 | 하나투어비즈니스</title>
    <style>
        :root { --dark-blue: #1a2a4e; --point-red: #e31a1a; }
        body { font-family: 'Pretendard', 'Malgun Gothic', sans-serif; background: #f0f2f5; margin: 0; padding: 20px; }
        
        /* 관리자 패널 */
        .admin-panel { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto 30px; background: #fff; padding: 25px; border-radius: 12px; border: 2px solid var(--dark-blue); box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
        .input-group { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .section-title { grid-column: span 3; font-size: 0.9em; font-weight: bold; color: var(--point-red); margin: 15px 0 5px; border-left: 4px solid var(--point-red); padding-left: 10px; }
        label { font-size: 0.85em; font-weight: bold; color: #333; margin-bottom: 5px; display: block; }
        input { width: 100%; padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ccc; border-radius: 4px; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 0.85em; }
        .col-2 { grid-column: span 2; }
        .col-3 { grid-column: span 3; }
        .print-btn { background: var(--point-red); color: white; padding: 15px; border: none; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer; width: 100%; font-size: 1.1em; margin-top: 10px; }

        /* 계약서 본문 스타일 */
        .page { width: 210mm; min-height: 297mm; padding: 20mm 18mm; margin: 0 auto; background: white; box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 1.7; color: #000; }
        .contract-title { text-align: center; font-size: 24pt; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline; margin-bottom: 40px; }
        .contract-intro { margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: justify; word-break: keep-all; }
        
        .info-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 25px; table-layout: fixed; }
        .info-table th, .info-table td { border: 1px solid #000; padding: 8px 12px; text-align: left; }
        .info-table th { background: #f2f2f2; width: 22%; font-weight: bold; }

        .article-title { font-weight: bold; margin-top: 15px; display: block; }
        .article-content { padding-left: 5px; margin-bottom: 10px; display: block; text-align: justify; }

        .signature-area { margin-top: 50px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 30px; }
        .sig-box { border: 1px solid #000; padding: 15px; height: 160px; position: relative; font-size: 9.5pt; }
        .sig-label { font-weight: bold; border-bottom: 1px solid #000; padding-bottom: 5px; margin-bottom: 10px; display: block; font-size: 11pt; }
        .sig-box p { margin: 4px 0; }
        .stamp { position: absolute; right: 30px; bottom: 20px; width: 65px; opacity: 0.4; }

        @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
        @media print {
            body { padding: 0; background: none !important; }
            .admin-panel { display: none !important; }
            .page { margin: 0 !important; border: none !important; box-shadow: none !important; width: 210mm; }
            * { -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact !important; print-color-adjust: exact !important; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="admin-panel">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0;">📝 연수 위탁계약서 생성기 (상세형)</h2>
